  "style": "TARGET THEME: Rainy overnight train compartment. Cream enamel upper panels, deep petrol-teal lower wall panels, rounded brass window surround and narrow mahogany structural ribs in the same framing. Visible rain streaks and dark blue woodland/distant station lights beyond window. Furniture rich dark walnut and deep petrol-teal ribbed upholstery/leather, brushed brass rails and discreet travel-style corner fittings. Warm quiet railway cabin light, cool rainy view. If scene contains plant, compact upright ficus in small brass planter in same position. No signage, numbers, route maps, luggage or extra props.",
  "runtimeEncoding": "lossless-webp"
